Agentix Platform
Copyright 2026 Varadharajan

This product includes infrastructure patterns adapted from the public
reference repository:

    syn-zhu/agentic-platform
    https://github.com/syn-zhu/agentic-platform

The following components are original work created for this project:

  * Synapse — the LangGraph/LangChain orchestration layer (synapse/),
    including all graph templates, the gateway-routed chat model,
    pluggable memory (MongoDB Atlas Vector Search and EverMemOS
    backends), tracing abstraction, A2A runtime, CRD export, and CLI.
  * The MongoDB Atlas Vector Search memory architecture with hybrid
    reciprocal-rank-fusion recall.
  * All documentation, architecture diagrams, and examples under docs/
    and synapse/examples/.

